					<p class="body1" align="left"><span class="body1 style73"> <h2>News archive</h2><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2007-10-10 | Wednesday</font></strong><br><br><img src="http://a954.ac-images.myspacecdn.com/images01/23/l_766af2cbf188f1c9fe4b71bd0de9bc81.jpg" alt="" width="403" height="640" /><br /><br />Bambu and Do D.A.T. slap you over your silly heads today with &quot;International Guerilla&#39;s Anthem&quot;.<br /><br /><strong><a href="http://www.zshare.net/audio/4133511d06ff8c/">Download (MP3)</a><br /><br /></strong>Peace<br />daps<strong><br /></strong><p></p><br><hr align="center" noshade size="1" width="400"><br><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2007-10-09 | Tuesday</font></strong><br><br><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">from the good homie <span style="font-weight: bold" class="Apple-style-span">Meli</span>:&nbsp;</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px"><span style="font-weight: bold" class="Apple-style-span"><br /></span></p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px"><strong>Nectar, Obese Productions, Wonder If You Care?, and PUSH</strong> have gotten together to offer discounted 3-Day Passes to all 3 shows for only one low price!</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; min-height: 15px; margin: 0px">&nbsp;</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">Tuesday, October 9</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">Wonder If You Care? Presents A Hip-Hop Showcase to Benefit Breast Cancer Research w/</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">NEEMA of UNEXPECTED ARRIVAL</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">Grynch</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">D. Black</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">Jay Barz</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">Positive ID</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">Anomilie</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">Terry Radjaw</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">Kublakai</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">Type</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">Black Senate</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">The Parker Brothaz</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">Hosted by Joseph Average</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">with DJ Money D</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">$7</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">9pm door</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">21 &amp; Over</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; min-height: 15px; margin: 0px">&nbsp;</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">Wednesday, October 10</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">PUSH and New Jack Hustlers Present A Benefit for N/NW</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">GRAFFITI ROCK with</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">Dyme Def</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">Dimmak</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">Graves</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">Bedroom Stompers</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">Phil in the Blank</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">Neezie Pleaze</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">N/NW</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">$5 cover with proceeds going to N/NW</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">8pm Doors</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">21 &amp; Over</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; min-height: 15px; margin: 0px">&nbsp;</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">Thursday, October 11</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">Nectar &amp; Obese Productions Present The Soundcatcher Tour with</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">DJ VADIM</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">ABSTRACT RUDE</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">Yarah Bravo</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">Gabriel Teodros</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">DJ Colin</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">$10 Adv.</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">8pm doors</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">21 &amp; Over</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; min-height: 15px; margin: 0px">&nbsp;</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px">A Limited Number of 3-Day Passes are available exclusively online at:</p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; color: #666666; margin: 0px"><span style="text-decoration: underline"><a href="http://www.BrownPaperTickets.com/event/22249">http://www.BrownPaperTickets.com/event/22249</a></span></p><p style="line-height: 19px; font: normal normal normal 13px/normal Arial; margin: 0px"><strong>FOR ONLY $12 !!!!</strong></p><p></p><br><hr align="center" noshade size="1" width="400"><br><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2007-10-05 | Friday</font></strong><br><br><img src="http://us.ent2.yimg.com/musicfinder.yahoo.com/images/yahoo/columbia/nas/nas.jpg" alt="" width="368" height="400" /><br /><br />Nas reminds us of another classic hip hop pose: The East Cost gun clapper.<br /><br />Nas - Surviving the Times:<br /><br />http://www.zshare.net/audio/4039474f6a535c/<br /><br />Peace<br />daps1<p></p><br><hr align="center" noshade size="1" width="400"><br><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2007-10-04 | Thursday</font></strong><br><br><img src="http://farm2.static.flickr.com/1054/1487440874_55a03286c9.jpg" alt="" /><br /><br />Wassupers? Today, DJ Daps1 and Geologic would like to take some blog space and perform some classic hip hop poses. There are dozens more, we&#39;re sure, but we hope that these poses can help out you, fellow hip hopper, in your quest to find the right pose for your album cover/myspace. Above is your basic hip hop duo and &quot;let em know you&#39;re here, world&quot; pose.<br /><br /><img src="http://farm2.static.flickr.com/1376/1486585459_85a9d8d7e7.jpg" alt="" /><br /><br />Classic crouch-down pose reminds me of Gangstarr&#39;s &quot;Hard to Earn&quot; LP cover. And no, we don&#39;t do this well cuz we&#39;re <em>&quot;asian&quot;. </em>Lollercopter.<br /><br /><img src="http://farm2.static.flickr.com/1204/1486584537_7da3f46055.jpg" alt="" /><br /><br />Every hip hop artist has to have that &quot;hey look at my back&quot; shot.<br /><br /><img src="http://farm2.static.flickr.com/1039/1487441404_893d7ec486.jpg" alt="" /><br /><br />&quot;Tougher than Leather&quot; pose. See how Geo&#39;s lookin one way and i&#39;m lookin at the camera? That&#39;s not even rehearsed, son!<br /><br /><img src="http://farm2.static.flickr.com/1133/1487500968_0439dfc5ee.jpg" alt="" /><br /><br />The East Coast &quot;Reachin&#39; Out&quot; shot. Reachin out to who(m) though?<br /><br /><img src="http://farm2.static.flickr.com/1223/1487442354_a3ab674336.jpg" alt="" /><br /><br />The West Coast swag pose. The snarl is extra.<br /><br /><img src="http://farm2.static.flickr.com/1237/1487442858_000b25c78f.jpg" alt="" /><br /><br />The 1981 high five pose. Usually there&#39;s 30 other people around you for this shot. Others can perform the crouch-down pose to make this shot a filthy one.<br /><br /><img src="http://farm2.static.flickr.com/1155/1487442628_0d0f257a90.jpg" alt="" /><br /><br />The &quot;conscious rapper&quot; pose, complete with pointing at the dome and rubbing of the third eye. <br /><br /><img src="http://farm2.static.flickr.com/1311/1487443256_45436fe579.jpg" alt="" /><br /><br />And finally, the &quot;Doin&#39; in the park, doin&#39; it after dark&quot; pose at Rockcreek Park, WA DC (yes, that very same Rockcreek Park). That&#39;s Kiwi in the center. And we managed to wear the same hats in the shot (good job).<br /><br />Good luck! And don&#39;t forget to post a &quot;NEW PICS!&quot; bulletin on myspace when you do so.<br /><br />Peace<br />daps1<p></p><br><hr align="center" noshade size="1" width="400"><br><strong><font color="#333300" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2">2007-10-04 | Thursday</font></strong><br><br>a while ago we started talking about what to do for the New Year.  after debating about where to play a show and who to put on it, we concluded that there was just way too much goin on in the town to limit an end-of-the-year celebration to just a couple of acts on the night of Dec 31st.  besides, i&#39;m sick of working on New Year&#39;s Eve!<br /><br /><br /><br />soooo, we decided to do a series of shows at a good intimate venue and put the whole Town on and call it <span style="font-weight: bold">The Program</span>.  it goes as follows:<br /><br /><br /><br /><span style="font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline">The Program</span> - December 18 - 22, 2007<br /><br /><span style="font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline"><br /><br />Tue Dec 18</span><br /><br />Blue Scholars<br />Secret Special Guest<br />Unexpected Arrival<br />Siren&#39;s Echo<br />DJ DV One<br /><br /><br /><br /><span style="font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline">Wed Dec 19</span><br /><br />Blue Scholars<br />Common Market<br />D. Black<br />Sleep of Old Dominion<br />Can-U<br />DJ Vitamin D<br /><br /><br /><br /><span style="font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline">Thur Dec 20</span><br /><br />Blue Scholars<br />Saturday Knights<br />Khingz<br />Grynch<br />DJ B-Mello<br /><br /><br /><br /><span style="font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline">Fri Dec 21</span><br /><br />Blue Scholars,<br />Dyme Def<br />J. Pinder<br />GMK<br />DJ Jake One<br /> <br /><span style="font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline">Sat Dec 22</span><br /><br />Blue Scholars<br />Cancer Rising<br />The Physics<br />DJ Bless One<br /><br /><span style="font-weight: bold">Neumo&#39;s</span><br /><span style="font-weight: bold">925 E Pike, Seattle WA</span><br /><span style="font-weight: bold">8:00 pm Doors</span><br /><span style="font-weight: bold">Advance Tickets $15; $18 DOS. </span><br /><br />Tickets at <a href="http://www.ticketswest.com">TicketsWest.com</a><br /><br /><br /><br />***All Shows <span style="font-weight: bold">ALL AGES </span>except Saturday December 22 (21 +)<br /><br /><br /><br />Limited Presale with the password of <strong><span style="font-weight: bold">&quot;</span>STRANGER&quot;</strong> or <span style="font-weight: bold">&quot;KEXP&quot;</span> starting October 8th. General public onsale starts October 12th at 10:00 a.m<br /><a href="http://ev12.evenue.net/cgi-bin/ncommerce3/ExecMacro/evenue/ev68/se/DisplayPromoList.d2w/report?linkID=twspok&amp;RSRC=&amp;RDAT=&amp;caller=PR">here</a>.<br /><br />and there you have it.  if you&#39;ve been a long time fan of Northwest hip hop, come thru!  if you&#39;re new to the scene, this week will be like a complete sampler of the best and brightest our town has to offer.<br /><br /><br /><br />saba<p></p><br><hr align="center" noshade size="1" width="400"><br><center><div class="pagenumbers"><A HREF="archive.php?from=60">[&lt;&lt;]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=0">[1]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=5">[2]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=10">[3]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=15">[4]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=20">[5]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=25">[6]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=30">[7]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=35">[8]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=40">[9]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=45">[10]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=50">[11]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=55">[12]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=60">[13]</A> [14] <A HREF="archive.php?from=70">[15]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=75">[16]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=80">[17]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=85">[18]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=90">[19]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=95">[20]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=100">[21]</A> <A HREF="archive.php?from=105">[2